  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A rectangle has a length of <math alttext=\"56\"><mn>56</mn>\n</math> inches and a width of <math alttext=\"28\"><mn>28</mn>\n</math> inches. What is the area, in square inches, of the rectangle?</p>",
